Z||000004||stimpy||11-08-2000||01:20 AM||||If you are not afraid of getting your hands a little dirty, and don't mind "subjecting" your passenger to have the same footrom that you do, a fiberglas enclosure that fits snugly in the passenger footwell that will hold up to a 10" sub is cheap and easy to make. Best of all, no permenant changes made to your car (no drilling, cutting, totally reversible.) E-mail me for details on how I built mine if interested.<P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
